%%{init: {'theme':'default', 'flowchart': {'nodeSpacing': 35, 'rankSpacing': 28}}}%%
flowchart TD
    Start([CSP user calls a Wiom Call Center or Trust Line number]) --> Check{Does this CSP have an active ticket?}
    Check -->|No| Audio[IVR plays 'no active ticket' message for CSP/Partner]
    Audio --> End[Call ends]
    Check -->|Yes| OOS[Out of scope - call routed via call-center queue / live agent]

    classDef start fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#4338ca,color:#312e81
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    classDef neutral fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    classDef oos fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#6b7280,color:#4b5563
    class Start start
    class Audio,End bad
    class OOS oos
